---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Scavland Factions & Reputation Guide — Scavland Wiki" description="Guide to the 10 factions in Scavland: faction territories, reputation standings, contract jobs, exclusive faction gear, and wasteland lore." keywords="Scavland factions, wasteland factions, reputation system, faction vendors, Scavland wiki, jobs and contracts" canonical="/factions/">
  <article class="article-layout">
    <header class="guide-header">
      <div class="meta-row">
        <span class="badge official">FACTION DIRECTORY</span>
        <time datetime="2026-08-31">Updated August 31, 2026</time>
      </div>
      <h1>Scavland 10 Factions &amp; Reputation Guide</h1>
      <p class="lede">Discover the 10 survivor groups vying for control of Zalesye: territorial influence, vendor access, alliance mechanics, and contract jobs.</p>
    </header>

    <div class="note" style="margin-bottom:2rem;background:var(--card-bg,#161616);border:1px solid var(--border-color,#333);padding:1.25rem;border-radius:8px;">
      <h3 style="margin:0 0 0.5rem 0;color:var(--accent,#ffaa00);">Faction System Overview</h3>
      <p style="margin:0;line-height:1.6;color:var(--text-muted,#ccc);">Zalesye is populated by 10 distinct factions. Completing jobs or trading with one faction will alter your reputation standings, unlocking specialized military gear, medical supplies, or turning rival factions hostile on sight.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="prose">
      <h2>Major Factions in Zalesye</h2>

      <div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit, minmax(260px, 1fr));gap:1rem;margin:1.5rem 0;">
        <div style="background:var(--card-bg,#161616);border:1px solid var(--border-color,#333);padding:1rem;border-radius:6px;">
          <h3 style="margin-top:0;color:#fff;">The Free Vultures</h3>
          <p style="font-size:0.9rem;color:var(--text-muted,#aaa);margin:0;">Independent scavengers and traders who inhabit neutral settlements. Open to trade and reliable sources for basic ammo, bandages, and lockpicks.</p>
        </div>
        <div style="background:var(--card-bg,#161616);border:1px solid var(--border-color,#333);padding:1rem;border-radius:6px;">
          <h3 style="margin-top:0;color:#fff;">Bunker Wardens</h3>
          <p style="font-size:0.9rem;color:var(--text-muted,#aaa);margin:0;">Remnants of Soviet military security personnel guarding underground installations. Heavily armored, armed with assault rifles, and suspicious of outsiders.</p>
        </div>
        <div style="background:var(--card-bg,#161616);border:1px solid var(--border-color,#333);padding:1rem;border-radius:6px;">
          <h3 style="margin-top:0;color:#fff;">Mist Ecologists &amp; Researchers</h3>
          <p style="font-size:0.9rem;color:var(--text-muted,#aaa);margin:0;">Scientific researchers studying anomaly phenomena and mutant mutations. Pay top dollar for rare anomaly artifacts and biological tissue samples.</p>
        </div>
        <div style="background:var(--card-bg,#161616);border:1px solid var(--border-color,#333);padding:1rem;border-radius:6px;">
          <h3 style="margin-top:0;color:#fff;">Marshland Marauders</h3>
          <p style="font-size:0.9rem;color:var(--text-muted,#aaa);margin:0;">Ruthless raiders who ambush supply caravans and solo stalkers across swamp sectors. Extreme caution is advised when crossing their turf.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <h2>How Faction Reputation Affects Gameplay</h2>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Trading Discounts &amp; Black Market:</strong> Raising loyalty unlocks tier-3 weapon blueprints, advanced optical scopes, and rare ammunition types.</li>
        <li><strong>Territory Patrols:</strong> Friendly factions will assist you if combat breaks out nearby, while hostile factions will open fire from guard towers.</li>
        <li><strong>Bounty Jobs &amp; Contracts:</strong> Taking elimination contracts from one faction will permanently lower your standing with their enemy group.</li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <footer class="guide-footer" style="margin-top:3rem;padding-top:1.5rem;border-top:1px solid var(--border-color,#333);display:flex;justify-content:space-between;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:1rem;">
      <a class="button secondary" href="/weapons/">Weapons Database →</a>
      <a class="button" href="/maps/">Explore World Map →</a>
    </footer>
  </article>
</Layout>
